Proof of $\boldsymbol{U} \boldsymbol{V} \perp \boldsymbol{AX}$.

Let $T = OX \cap BC$, and let $OX$ intersect $\odot(ABC)$ at points $Y, Z$. Then, we apply Desargues Involution Theorem (DIT) on $BCUV$ and line $OX$. We get an involution that
- swaps $T$ and $UV \cap OX$;
